From 9033f096aa628ecda779ad9b70a7f1f1e3308d1c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 21:00:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: portable in-app Ollama bootstrap without MSI

Download the official Windows zip / Linux tgz into the product data
dir, start serve, and pull models on the splash without restarting.
Reuse a healthy system daemon on 11434; only kill the Ollama PID this
app started.
